# chat i made a font AND a file format

#   gstart <c>
#   <stroke> <numbers...>
#   gend

# wow so difficult

# Stroke types:
#   line    x0 y0 x1 y1                     (start, end)
#   bezier  x0 y0 x1 y1 x2 y2 x3 y3         (start, 2 control points, end)
#   hermite x0 y0 x1 y1 rx0 ry0 rx1 ry1     (start, end, start/end ROC)
#   dot     cx cy r                         (center, radius)

# "#" means comment, blank line is ignored
# if no glyph def, diamond replacement character is drawn


